    <p class="lp-direct-answer"><strong>Our starting point:</strong> consider Close if you also need a CRM. Check Apollo if your team already pays for it. Compare PhoneBurner and Mojo for individual calling. Look at Nooks and Orum for dedicated team workflows. The right shortlist depends on your list, your callers and your budget.</p>
    <p class="lp-method"><strong>Sources checked {{ guide.reviewed }}.</strong> CallTeam is a B2B cold calling agency. This guide combines our calling experience with the official product sources linked in each review. It is not a controlled ten-product benchmark. Our website lists Apollo, Close and Orum as technology partners. Prices and features are vendor information; the verdicts are CallTeam’s assessment.</p>
